The plugin fetches the micromamba 2.9.0-0 standalone bootstrap from its
official release after the user consents. Its platform SHA-256 digests are
pinned in src/runtime.ts.
https://github.com/mamba-org/micromamba-releases/releases/tag/2.9.0-0

runtime/*.tsv records the exact conda-forge archive path, SHA-256 and byte
count from an explicit solve for each platform. The environment includes
Python 3.14.10, Manim Community 0.22.1, Typst Python bindings 0.15.2 and
FFmpeg 9.0.2. The installer keeps upstream license files under env/licenses.
https://conda-forge.org/

After local setup consent, automatic narration uses the official Kyutai
Pocket TTS v4.0.1 native release (archive filenames report 3.3.0), under the
MIT license. The package includes a copy of that license for the upstream
English 18M config, changed to use only local model and tokenizer paths.
https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts/releases/tag/v4.0.1
https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts/blob/a922b912dfa366975294afb568d815b305acde5d/pocket_tts/config/english_18m_2026-10.yaml

The downloaded English model, tokenizer and Alba voice state are published
by Kyutai under CC BY 4.0. The voice is performed by Alba MacKenna (CC BY 4.0).
https://huggingface.co/kyutai/pocket-tts-without-voice-cloning/tree/a7056f505a4a8ca72d8b5fb1440071d6f1a35739/languages/english_18m_2026-10
https://huggingface.co/kyutai/tts-voices#alba-mackenna
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Optional reference narration uses MLX Audio 0.6.5 (MIT), MLX 0.32.4 (MIT),
and the pinned Apple Silicon dependencies in runtime/voice/mlx-osx-arm64.txt.
https://pypi.org/project/mlx-audio/0.6.5/
https://pypi.org/project/mlx/0.32.4/

The optional setup downloads the following files under their upstream terms.
Their revisions and file digests are pinned in src/reference-voice.ts and
runtime/voice/sesame-model.tsv. The plugin archive contains neither the weights
nor the tokenizer files.

- Sesame CSM 1B, converted to 8-bit MLX by MLX Community (Apache 2.0).
  https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/csm-1b-8bit/tree/fcf0cc857eade3615a60f30722cf5197d4f88406
- Kyutai Mimi audio codec checkpoint (CC BY 4.0).
  https://huggingface.co/kyutai/moshiko-pytorch-bf16/tree/2bfc9ae6e89079a5cc7ed2a68436010d91a3d289
- Meta Llama 3.2 tokenizer files from Unsloth (Llama 3.2 Community License).
  https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Llama-3.2-1B/tree/9535bd9b1d1dea6acafbdc4813b728796aeb28da
